    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm having a huge migraine right now. it literally just slammed into me out of nowhere, like it went from nothing to a 10/10 pain in like a second. i've had bad migraines for years so i know the feeling, but this one is just way more intense than usual. i'm feeling a bit sick to my stomach too. should i just take my sumatriptan and try to sleep it off? i really don't want to go to the hospital if it's just a bad migraine flare up.",
